== Climate

Hatra has a [[ hot semi-arid climate ]] ([[ Köppen climate classification ]]
//BSh//). Most rain falls in the winter. The average annual temperature in
Hatra is 20.7 °C (69.3 °F). About 257 mm (10.12 in) of precipitation falls
annually.

